#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:27
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "A holder chooses records to share"
msgstr "Un titular elige registros para compartir"

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:31
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Build and sign the ITI-YY5 manifest request"
msgstr "Construir y firmar la solicitud de manifiesto ITI-YY5"

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:31
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Build the ITI-YY5 request: POST <url>/List/_search with the form body (passcode only when the P flag is set), its Content-Digest and its RFC 9421 HTTP Message Signature. The host sends it over mutual TLS."
msgstr "Construir la petición ITI-YY5: POST <url>/List/_search con el cuerpo del formulario (código de paso sólo cuando se establece la bandera P), su Contenido-Digest y su RFC 9421 HTTP Message Signature."

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:33
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Documents read"
msgstr "Documentos que deben leerse"

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:28
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Generate a 32-byte random key for the link and encrypt each document as JWE compact, dir / A256GCM."
msgstr "Generar una clave aleatoria de 32 bytes para el enlace y cifrar cada documento como compacto JWE, dir / A256GCM."

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:28
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Generate the link key and encrypt each document"
msgstr "Generar la clave de enlace y cifrar cada documento"

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:29
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Issue the VHL payload (url, key, exp, flag, label) as a CBOR map at HCERT key 5, signed like any HCERT."
msgstr "Emitir la carga útil VHL (url, key, exp, flag, label) como un mapa CBOR en la tecla HCERT 5, firmado como cualquier HCERT."

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:29
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Issue the VHL payload as an HCERT (key 5, CBOR map)"
msgstr "Emitir la carga útil de la BVS como HCERT (teclado 5, mapa CBOR)"

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:10
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Journeys J4.0 and J4.1: the sharer issues one passcode-protected VHL per family member; a clinic abroad verifies it, retrieves the manifest over mutual TLS (the host's HTTP) and decrypts the documents (IHE ITI-YY3 to ITI-YY5)."
msgstr "Journeys J4.0 y J4.1: el sharer emite una BVS protegida por código de paso por miembro de la familia; una clínica en el extranjero la verifica, recupera el manifiesto sobre TLS mutuo (el HTTP del anfitrión) y descifra los documentos (IHE ITI-YYY3 a ITI-YY5)."

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:32
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Read the manifest Bundle and decrypt each document"
msgstr "Lea el manifiesto Bundle y descifre cada documento"

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:32
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Read the searchset Bundle the sharer returns and decrypt each document with the link key, accepting zip DEF."
msgstr "Lea el conjunto de búsquedas Agrupar el sharer devuelve y desencriptar cada documento con la clave de enlace, aceptando zip DEF."

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:7
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Share records by Verifiable Health Link"
msgstr "Compartir registros por Verificable Health Link"

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:20
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "The IHE ITI VHL Receiver side: scans a VHL, retrieves the manifest and reads the documents."
msgstr "El lado receptor IHE ITI VHL: escanea una VHL, recupera el manifiesto y lee los documentos."

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:14
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "The IHE ITI VHL Sharer side: issues Verifiable Health Links and hosts their manifests."
msgstr "El IHE ITI VHL Sharer lado: cuestiones Verificables Enlaces de salud y los anfitriones de sus manifiestos."

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:30
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Verify the VHL as an HCERT, and refuse a link whose exp has passed."
msgstr "Verificar la BVS como un HCERT, y rechazar un enlace cuya exp ha pasado."

#: processes/content/vhl-sharing.bpmn:30
#. Diagram label
#, fuzzy
msgid "Verify the VHL HCERT and its exp"
msgstr "Verificar la BVS HCERT y su exp"

